OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother largely sunny and dry
OL,6,Fday for most, although a risk of a few
OL,7,Fshowers developing later in the day
OL,8,Fthat could be heavy and thundery.
OL,9,FStill feeling hot.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly dry overnight with
OL,12,Fvariable cloud and some clear spells,
OL,13,Falthough still the chance of isolated
OL,14,Fthundery showers. Still feeling warm
OL,15,Fand rather muggy for most. Winds
OL,16,Fmainly light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
