OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FVariable cloud and isolated
OL,6,Fthundery showers possible at first but
OL,7,Fbecoming dry with sunny spells.
OL,8,FGradually turning fresher later with a
OL,9,Fgentle breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,12,Fand Monday, largely dry with bright or
OL,13,Fsunny spells. Mainly light winds.
OL,14,FCloudier and breezier Tuesday.
OL,15,FTemperatures nearer average.
